{
  "name": "mica",
  "description": "A cross-platform GPU-accelerated exporter for Procreate (.procreate) files, utilizing WGPU for high-performance layer compositing and rendering. It implements a specialized parser for Apple's NSKeyedArchive format and handles tiled raster data compressed with LZO or LZ4 algorithms. The system enables accurate reproduction of digital art layers by simulating Procreate's blending pipeline and premultiplied alpha compositing.",
